+**Multiplier.**
+- **Placement:** place a gained token immediately onto the named Action card. A **bonus-tile Multiplier may go on any Action card, including Animals**.
+- **Two executions:** on its next use, you may execute that action twice in succession at the same base strength. Move the Action card only after both executions.
+- **X-tokens:** each X-token boosts only one execution.
+- **Additional Multipliers:** each additional token used adds one execution; two tokens permit up to three actions, not four.
+- **Choices:** you may choose different permitted options within each regular execution (Sponsors could play cards then take money). A multiplied X-token alternative may take two X-tokens, subject to the five-token cap, but may not mix one X-token action with one regular action.
+- **Timing:** defer after-finishing effects until all executions are done. A break triggered by the first execution waits until the entire turn is finished.
+- **Return:** return used tokens to the supply. Remove an unused token during the next break.
 
